#: ../../../source/refs/controllers.cores3.ref
msgid "CoreS3"
msgstr "CoreS3"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:7
msgid "Support the following products:"
msgstr "支持以下产品："

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:9
msgid "|CoreS3|"
msgstr "|CoreS3|"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:12
msgid "Supported Components"
msgstr "支持的组件"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:14
msgid "CoreS3 supports the following components:"
msgstr "CoreS3 支持以下组件："

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:16
msgid "`M5UI <../m5ui/index.html>`_: The ``m5ui`` LVGL component library."
msgstr "`M5UI <../m5ui/index.html>`_：``m5ui`` LVGL 组件库。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:17
msgid ""
"`Module <../module/index.html>`_: The ``module`` package for expansion "
"modules."
msgstr "`Module <../module/index.html>`_：用于扩展模块的 ``module`` 软件包。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:18
msgid "`Unit <../unit/index.html>`_: The ``unit`` package containing Unit drivers."
msgstr "`Unit <../unit/index.html>`_：包含 Unit 驱动的 ``unit`` 软件包。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:19
msgid ""
"`USB <../advanced/usb/device/index.html>`_: The ``usb.device`` package for "
"HID devices."
msgstr "`USB <../advanced/usb/device/index.html>`_：用于 HID 设备的 ``usb.device`` 软件包。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:20
msgid ""
"`M5Camera <../advanced/camera.html>`_: The frozen ``m5camera.py`` camera "
"helper."
msgstr "`M5Camera <../advanced/camera.html>`_：冻结的 ``m5camera.py`` 摄像头辅助模块。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:21
msgid "`Chain <../chain/index.html>`_: The ``chain`` package for Chain devices."
msgstr "`Chain <../chain/index.html>`_：用于 Chain 设备的 ``chain`` 软件包。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:24
msgid "Supported Display Fonts"
msgstr "支持的显示字体"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:26
msgid ""
"The CoreS3 firmware includes the following Montserrat fonts for LVGL and "
"M5UI: ``lv.font_montserrat_12``, ``lv.font_montserrat_14``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_16``, ``lv.font_montserrat_18``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_24``, ``lv.font_montserrat_40``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_44``, and ``lv.font_montserrat_48``."
msgstr ""
"CoreS3 固件为 LVGL 和 M5UI 提供以下 Montserrat "
"字体：``lv.font_montserrat_12``、``lv.font_montserrat_14``、``lv.font_montserrat_16``、``lv.font_montserrat_18``、``lv.font_montserrat_24``、``lv.font_montserrat_40``、``lv.font_montserrat_44``"
" 和 ``lv.font_montserrat_48``。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:31
msgid ""
"For ``M5.Lcd.FONTS``, the firmware also provides ``AlibabaPuHuiTiCN24``, "
"``AlibabaSansJA24``, and ``AlibabaSansKR24`` for Chinese, Japanese, and "
"Korean text respectively."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``M5.Lcd.FONTS``，固件还提供 ``AlibabaPuHuiTiCN24``、``AlibabaSansJA24`` 和 "
"``AlibabaSansKR24``，分别用于显示中文、日文和韩文。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:36
msgid "Board Features"
msgstr "板载功能"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:38
msgid "CoreS3 supports the following built-in functions and board peripherals:"
msgstr "CoreS3 支持以下内置功能和板载外设："

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:40
msgid "`Display <../hardware/display.html>`_: 2.0-inch, 320 x 240 color LCD output."
msgstr "`显示屏 <../hardware/display.html>`_：2.0 英寸、320 x 240 分辨率的彩色液晶显示屏输出。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:41
msgid "`Touch <../hardware/touch.html>`_: Capacitive touch input."
msgstr "`触摸 <../hardware/touch.html>`_：电容式触摸输入。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:42
msgid ""
"`IMU <../hardware/imu.html>`_: BMI270 accelerometer and gyroscope, and "
"BMM150 magnetometer readings."
msgstr "`IMU <../hardware/imu.html>`_：读取 BMI270 加速度计、陀螺仪和 BMM150 磁力计数据。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:43
msgid ""
"`ALS <../hardware/als.html>`_: Built-in LTR-553ALS-WA ambient light sensor "
"readings."
msgstr "`环境光传感器 <../hardware/als.html>`_：读取内置 LTR-553ALS-WA 环境光传感器数据。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:44
msgid ""
"`Camera <../advanced/camera.html>`_: Image capture with the built-in GC0308 "
"camera."
msgstr "`摄像头 <../advanced/camera.html>`_：使用内置 GC0308 摄像头采集图像。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:45
msgid ""
"`Speaker <../hardware/speaker.html>`_ playback and `microphone "
"<../hardware/mic.html>`_ recording."
msgstr "`扬声器 <../hardware/speaker.html>`_ 播放和 `麦克风 <../hardware/mic.html>`_ 录音。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:46
msgid "BM8563 real-time clock for date and time keeping."
msgstr "BM8563 实时时钟，用于保持日期和时间。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:47
msgid ""
"`Power <../system/power.html>`_: Battery, charging, and external output "
"power management."
msgstr "`电源 <../system/power.html>`_：电池、充电和外部输出电源管理。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:48
msgid "microSD card access through ``hardware.SDCard``."
msgstr "通过 ``hardware.SDCard`` 访问 microSD 卡。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/cores3.rst:49
msgid "Grove and M-BUS expansion interfaces."
msgstr "Grove 和 M-BUS 扩展接口。"

